  identity: "consumer_relies_on_incidental_realization_property" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a consumer relies on a property of its provider's current implementation that the provider's contract does not promise. HARM: a contract-preserving provider change can invalidate the consumer, and even the current implementation may establish only part of the property the consumer assumes. Agreement on happy-path output conceals the missing guarantee; reviewing the implementation alone cannot repair the dependency contract.",

    "SOURCE-VERIFIED SPECIMEN, NOT AN EXECUTED REPRODUCTION: gunbc.durable_cas_file_store cas_commit_at uses extdeps.filesystem.filesystem_io Filesystem.WriteOwnerOnly as the publication primitive for a CAS generation. v1_compiler.v1_interpreter write_file_owner_only opens the FINAL path with create_new and then calls write_all. A post-open failure can leave partial slot bytes visible. The adjacent write_file_create_new contract explicitly says owner-only O_EXCL is incidental to creation-time permissions, not a create-only contract. Its complete-content-before-publication realization is owned by extdeps.filesystem.rust_realization. No partial-write perturbation was executed for this finding.",

    "DISTINGUISHING FACT: the class is consumer reliance on an incidental realization property, not merely a partial-write bug. Owner-only permission and exclusive complete publication are different obligations. The CAS consumer borrows the first operation's current exclusion behavior while needing the second contract. Persisting and verifying immutable objects upstream cannot repair a torn generation file at the mutable target's publication point. Correctly classifying a failed write also cannot restore that file's integrity.",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: silent wrongness for the unsupported publication guarantee, outside the ladder. CEILING: structurally guaranteed for the internal contract-to-consumer binding once required publication capabilities are modeled and checked by acceptance; external crash durability still requires observation at its declared boundary and is not made true by a type. NEXT TRIGGER: the CAS consumer binds to an explicit exclusive, complete, durable publication contract at the existing realization home, with acceptance refusing an insufficient provider and executed publication evidence distinguishing failed preparation from a visible complete generation. A renamed helper, corrected error arm, or isolated O_EXCL contention test is insufficient.",

    "DISPOSITION: contractual publication precedes refusal repair in the Phase 1 cut. Repairs belong to extdeps.filesystem.rust_realization and gunbc.durable_cas_file_store, not an SCM-local safe-write helper. gunbc.fabric_control_plane already consumes this CAS realization; the absence of an SCM consumer today limits SCM exposure, not the existing defect. The repair lane owes the discriminating RED.",

    "CONSUMPTION: this per-class record joins the derived gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.roster recurring_failure_mode_roster, consumed by gunbc.design_ledgers and checked by the required parse-phase rostered-row join. Its concrete downstream planning consumer is docs/plans/native-scm-cas-fit-and-consumer-cut.md. This source-verified finding is not an execution receipt.",
  ],

